(focus on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions; NOT interested in equipment promotions or photographer's private life).\n\nLooking at the candidates, they have different content types based on their descriptions:\n1. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - explains from light, imaging, visual relationships - matches interest well\n2. **操作记录** (operation records) - practical parameter adjustment records - matches interest well\n3. **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists common concepts - matches interest reasonably\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - records photography exhibition curation, author biography, artwork circulation, art activities history - this is about art history/exhibitions, less about shooting methods\n5. **市场观察** (market observation) - summarizes camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is equipment promotion, which the user explicitly does NOT want\n\nSo the user explicitly does not want 市场观察 (market observation/equipment promotion) content. The interest says \"不关注器材促销\" (not interested in equipment promotion). The 市场观察 candidates are exactly about camera purchase packages, promotions, celebrity endorsements - these should be excluded.\n\nThe 专题观察 candidates are about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biography, artwork circulation - this is more about art history and viewing experience, not actual shooting methods. These are less aligned with the interest which focuses on shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments.\n\nThe best matches are:\n- **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - directly about imaging principles and adjustments\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - directly about practical shooting parameter adjustments\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists concepts for further reading\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need to select 20 from the 80 exposed.\n\nLet me identify the candidates that best match the interest. The int